    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 2 Havenwood, Nursing Home, Ballygunner, Waterford, X91 XED2\r\n\r\nWell-Presented 2 Bedroomed semi-detached bungalow in a Popular Over-55s Development\r\n\r\nNo. 2 Havenwood is a bright and spacious two-bedroom ground floor semi detached property, presented in excellent condition throughout. Situated within the well-established Havenwood retirement development in Ballygunner, this property offers comfortable, low-maintenance living in a peaceful setting, while remaining within easy reach of Waterford City and a host of local amenities.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation extends to an entrance hall leading to a generous open-plan sitting room and kitchen/dining area, creating a bright and welcoming living space. The property comprises two bedrooms—a spacious double and a single bedroom—both benefiting from half-glazed external timber door opening directly onto the outdoor area, allowing plenty of natural light and easy access outside.\r\n\r\nA fully tiled wet room and a convenient hot press complete the accommodation.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property enjoys parking and is set within attractive, well-maintained communal grounds.\r\n\r\nThis is an ideal opportunity for those seeking to down-size while retaining independence in a secure and established community.\r\n\r\nManagement Fee: €940.00 per month\r\n\r\nAccommodation:-(see floor plan for layout)\r\nEntrance Hall 2m x 1.49m\r\nBright Sitting Room 4.43m x 3.38m with electric fire\r\nOpen Plan Kitchen/Dining Area 6.01m x 2.42m with dishwasher, integrated hob, oven & washing machine\r\nDouble Bedroom with half-glazed external timber door to outdoor area 3.83 x 2.80m with walk in wardrobe\r\nSingle Bedroom with half-glazed external timber door to outdoor area 2.58m x 3.21m\r\nWet Room 2.14m x 1.19m with electric shower\r\nHot Press\r\n\r\nPlease scroll through our photographs to view lay out and presentation of this property and click on the virtual tour icon for a walk through. \r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\nThese particulars do not constitute an offer or contract, and whilst every effort has been made in preparing all descriptions, dimensions, maps, and plans, these details should not be relied upon as fact. Dimensions / Illustrations are for guideline purposes only and not to scale. Hutchinson Auctioneers Property Specialists - Team Hutchinson will not hold itself responsible for any inaccuracies contained therein."
      },
